      <PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>Pup Profile's mission is to provide a platform to showcase &amp; support dogs who are at risk of being euthanized at overcrowded shelters. Pup Profile connects rescues, networkers, fosters, adopters, and donors with rescue and shelter dogs that need support. Interested adopters can browse available dogs from rescues across the region, those wanting to foster can fill out a foster interest form and will be connected with a rescue, and sponsors can donate to support Pup Profile operations or dogs in need.</PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>
