        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>Dog Adoption Program: Designed and built pupprofile.org, an online platform to showcase and support both shelter and rescue dogs. Onboarded 20 rescue and networker Community Partners, and promoted their dogs' profiles through social media promotion and Google Advertising.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
